    limit 1),
  'on july 17, 2026, dhs published a final rule establishing a fixed time period of admission and an extension of stay procedure for f nonimmigrant academic students, j exchange visitors and representatives of foreign information media.', 'On July 17, 2026, DHS published a final rule establishing a fixed time period of admission and an extension of stay procedure for F nonimmigrant academic students, J exchange visitors and representatives of foreign information media.', 'manual', 1.00,
